    "updated_at": "2026-06-22T21:00:43Z",
    "body": "No, the planned navigation is (confusingly) different from the ongoing navigation.\nWhen a form is submitted, there is no ongoing navigation until the task in step 4 of [plan-to-navigate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#plan-to-navigate) is run. ",
