    "updated_at": "2026-06-22T21:13:06Z",
    "body": "Well, the intent of #12076 was to specify this case (and it did work when I implemented it).\n\nI'm a bit rusty on my memory here since there are many async tasks flying around, but for the test case mentioned here, my understanding is that the test case still works with the change in #12706 applied since with the queueing order the ongoing navigation is still changed and forms planned navigation does not come into play.\n\nBut anyhow, my belief with https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12120 is that probably the right direction is to remove what was applied with #12076 and move the handling into form navigation with some type of spec prose to remove the pending navigations",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
