    "created_at": "2026-06-22T21:24:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-22T21:24:56Z",
    "body": "Hmm… they are queued onto different task sources (DOM manipulation task source for form planned navigation vs Navigation and traversal task source for javascript: navigation) so my understanding is that it's implementation-defined which order they should happen. Although, if they were queued onto the same task source instead, it would be guaranteed to have the wrong behaviour, since any pending `javascript:` navigations existing at the time of the form submit would run before the form submission navigation.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
